## 1. Purpose

This matrix traces every requirement to the risk that motivates it, the test
that verifies it, the run that executed the test and the evidence that run
produced. Gaps are shown as prominently as coverage: the section listing
requirements with no verifying test is always present, because an absent heading
looks like an absent question.

